Parts of this package are adapted from AperiSolve
(https://github.com/Zeecka/AperiSolve, release 3.7.15, commit 4ac7f26):
the analyzer definitions, the bit-plane decomposer, colour remapping, file
type tags and the PCRT-based PNG repair (png_repair.py).

PNG repair additionally credits PCRT and its forks:
  sherlly (https://github.com/sherlly/PCRT)
  Etr1x (https://github.com/Etr1x/PCRT3)
  indonumberone (https://github.com/indonumberone/PCRT3)

